# Nested panels & strips

Recurring bug: opaque parent cards and traps that hide mountain backgrounds.

## Parent shells

- Prefer soft cream wash / frosted glass (`bg-white/10`–`bg-white/20`, blur) over solid white
- Full section photo must remain readable behind mist
- Reject: solid cream wall on half the section that clips the landscape

## Sibling full-bleed strips

When design shows a band **below** a card cluster (e.g. Trusted Worldwide):

```
section
  └─ intro + cards (optional glass parent)
  └─ strip  ← sibling, full-bleed, NOT inside the glass parent
```

Do not nest that strip inside the frosted parent.

## Metrics / topic bars

- Prefer **vertical borders only** between cells
- Last cell may be transparent for script quote + vertical words (no bg image, no fill)
- Keep bar close under cards (`mt-6` / `mt-7`)

## Journal / promo banners

Glass banner with mountain `bg-image` is allowed when the screenshot shows it. Match that; do not flatten to solid cream.
